    "body": "pulse task #2795 \u00b7 generation 1.\n\n<!-- pulse-operation:276faed7a7fc17dd5cba1038ca204021 -->\n\nassigned to @PORTALSURFER. the frozen task plan is retained in pulse and copied below.\n\n# Pulse task #2795: Append browser devices by dropping onto track headers\n\nOperation: 276faed7a7fc17dd5cba1038ca204021\nAssignee: PORTALSURFER (Pulse #1, GitHub ID 41680373)\n\nUserrequest18October2026: allow dragging a device onto an existing track HEAD/header; append it to end of that track's devicechain. Relatedmerged2333/PR183 coverslanedrops,2136/2262existingrail/dropinstrumentcontracts, noheader-targetfollowupfound. Reuseactualregisteredbrowserdragpayload/stableTrackId/canonicalcommands+oneUndo. Effectheaderdrop appends afterall existingeffects, no extra track/duplicatecommand, preserveclips/devicestate/selectionexceptintendedselectionfeedback. Instrumentheaderdrop must honoractualmodel instrumentposition/one-instrument constraint; inspectcurrentchainmodel and report any conflict withliteralendappend BEFORE silentlyreplacinginstrument or inventingrouting/topology. Noautomaticoccupiedinstrumentreplacement merelyfromheaderunlessexplicitexistingmodelcontractsupportsandprimaryresolves. Wrong/stale/removed/unsupported/cancel leavesProject/historyaudio unchanged, visiblevalid/invalidtargetpreview; no headerresize/volume/rename/selectgestureinterference. Meaningfulrendereddragtarget+actualServicehistory tests endorder/emptychain/audio+MIDI/invalid/stale/cancel/UndoRedo. Preserveexisting2333lanegap/emptyspace+railreorder/sampledrag. Samecanonicalintakebeforeimplementation/PORTALSURFERassignmentreviewreadback/localCIonly. DedicatedmergerfinalCI+merges; rootsoleMac/optimizeddelivery. Sourceownercheckpointexistingworkbeforewritingoverlappingtracks.rs, coordinate331gainhotfiles. Noapp/backend/install/launch/quit/unlock/permissions/userdata.\n\ncreated by pulse shared PR intake/start task. builds, checks and merging follow the repository's own instructions.",
